            "notes": "Start calmly, don't take unnecessary risks unless you have a support who can save you or keep you alive (e.g., Mercy, Kirko, etc.). \nPower Playbook will increase the damage of your Bola Shot, so it will be important to start with.\nArmored Vest can be very useful if there is a Soldier or an Ashe. If you see them and they have you in their sights, run.\n\nAs for Compensator, I mainly use it to finish off with a Take Aim, but if but if you don't have enough aim, you can use Shady Spectacles to hold out a little longer.",
