            "notes": "In round 2, we sell Compensator to recover some money. Since this is quick play, the money you earn is huge, and if round 1 goes on for a long time, you'll earn even more.\n\nThe base is now:\nLiquid Nitrogen: Together with So Cooked, it will allow you to destroy them all and make better use of your Powers. \nWindwalker Boots: I carry them to give us better shooting range and mobility to hit our Bola Shot more effectively (plus the cooldown reduction is very useful). \nEnergized Bracers: This time it's a very useful item. You'll probably have a lot of bounty that you'll want to keep, or at least you'll want to survive, so this will help you.\n\nOptional:\nIf you don't have enough money for the top 3, avoid buying Liquid Nitrogen and go for Nano Cola and the other 2. It won't completely compensate, but at least your Bola Shot will still be dangerous.\nIf you have money left over, you can buy Multi-tool and get even more cooldown reduction. If you can't afford it, you can keep Armored Vest and Power Playbook or buy Custom Stock. \nThat's up to you and depends on how the game is going.",
