            "notes": "In round 3, we absolutely must have Liquid Nitrogen and Cybervenom, so lock in and start dominating the game, understood? \n\nJoking aside:\nCybervenom will complete our Happy Couples Exterminator combo. With this thing, you'll be the enemy's worst nightmare... or the poor fool who gets focused on, depending on how things go for you.\n\nOptional:\nAgain, if you keep messing up in the rounds and don't have enough money... well, you're a little screwed, honestly. The only thing I can tell you is to buy Liquid Nitrogen and Cybervenom, selling everything you have, and then see what else might be useful (Multi-tool and Energized Bracers would be the most useful, I think).\n\nNow, if you have money to spare because you've become humanity's number one enemy, go for Nano Cola or Multi-tool, they'll help you maximize damage.\nIf you're a reverend *bad word meant as a compliment* and you managed to destroy round 2 (it can happen), go for Catalytic Crystal or Champion's Kit to annoy them even more.\nIf the enemy has a Pharah, seriously consider buying Skyline Nanites to take down that flying rat.",
