            "created_at": "2025-09-01T16:37:52.463399+00:00",
            "notes": "If you've made it this far, damn, this stuff is serious. \nIn that case, you, your team, and the enemy team did very well. You should have enough money to buy everything I'm going to mention.\n\nHere you choose the power you want. Personally, I like to go with Seekerpoint. It's the only one I've had the chance to try in Round 5 so far, and it worked very well for me (I only made it to Round 5 about twice using this build; sometimes I didn't even make it past Round 3 because we won). \n\nThis is where we lose our minds: \nChampion's Kit: for more Ability Power\nLiquid Nitrogen: to make Lille Faelde and So Cooked hurt the enemy \nCybervenom: The terror of supports, especially with So Cooked\nCatalytic Crystal: Spamming as many mini bolas as possible with this thing will give us a few ultimates. Use them as you see fit (Small Combo: Updraft, Mini Bola Shot, Ultimate Bola Shot = BIG DAMAGE) \nIridiscent Iris: If you do the combo above, this will help you come out on top and survive a little longer.\nWindwalker Boots: To finish seasoning our dish, we rise high into the air and hit a mini Bola Shot and a full Bola Shot that will destroy everyone.\n\nOptional:\nSkyline Nanites: I don't think I need to explain why we're carrying this item instead of Windwalker Boots... Bite me, Pharah",
